WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.520 --> 01:35.170
[Romance on the Farm]

01:35.640 --> 01:37.910
[Episode 2]

01:38.259 --> 01:39.380
Shen Nuo,

01:40.460 --> 01:41.979
-You’re finally here.
-Man'er.

01:43.820 --> 01:44.970
What happened to you?

01:45.500 --> 01:46.460
It's all your fault.

01:47.240 --> 01:47.870
We agreed on the time.

01:47.900 --> 01:48.660
What took you so long?

01:49.380 --> 01:49.970
Look.

01:51.140 --> 01:52.460
I brought our child here.

01:53.270 --> 01:53.750
Here.

01:54.180 --> 01:54.890
Our child?

01:56.710 --> 01:57.620
Our?

02:02.820 --> 02:04.860
Our child.

02:05.460 --> 02:07.540
Our poor child.

02:08.740 --> 02:10.830
I won't be able to see you grow up anymore.

02:11.700 --> 02:14.100
We're so sorry to you.

02:15.060 --> 02:15.660
Man'er.

02:15.820 --> 02:17.340
This...

02:17.980 --> 02:18.700
Man'er,

02:19.010 --> 02:20.340
I've heard you mention before

02:20.700 --> 02:21.370
that your family members

02:21.400 --> 02:22.510
are all very sensible.

02:22.920 --> 02:23.579
This was indeed

02:23.600 --> 02:24.470
our mistake.

02:25.380 --> 02:26.160
But I believe

02:26.190 --> 02:27.079
that as long as we explain things,

02:27.450 --> 02:28.340
the elders in your family

02:28.490 --> 02:29.940
won't give us a hard time.

02:31.500 --> 02:32.940
Grandpa, I hope you'll give us your blessings.

02:35.590 --> 02:36.440
Scholar Lian,

02:36.940 --> 02:38.740
you said she's unmarried,

02:38.770 --> 02:40.220
but now, she even has a baby!

02:40.380 --> 02:41.260
How can I

02:41.280 --> 02:42.750
explain this to Lord Sun?

02:42.780 --> 02:43.380
No.

02:43.530 --> 02:44.480
That's not true.

02:44.780 --> 02:46.260
Don't listen to their nonsense.

02:46.500 --> 02:48.170
Man'er, look at you.

02:48.530 --> 02:49.850
As a girl,

02:50.100 --> 02:52.270
reputation is the most important thing.

02:52.820 --> 02:54.420
No matter how unwilling you are to get married,

02:54.700 --> 02:56.260
you shouldn't pull this kind of trick

02:56.410 --> 02:57.250
and ruin your reputation

02:57.280 --> 02:58.660
for no reason.

02:59.540 --> 03:00.100
Man'er,

03:00.700 --> 03:02.000
I think this baby

03:02.020 --> 03:03.460
looks like a newborn.

03:04.140 --> 03:05.730
When my parents and I

03:05.760 --> 03:07.280
came home to pray to our ancestors,

03:07.310 --> 03:08.620
you didn't show any signs of pregnancy yet.

03:09.100 --> 03:10.780
How could this child be yours?

03:11.580 --> 03:12.700
Hua'er, you're so knowledgable in this.

03:13.220 --> 03:13.860
Could it be

03:14.100 --> 03:15.100
that you've had a baby too?

03:15.680 --> 03:17.570
Man'er, you're so shameless!

03:17.590 --> 03:18.690
If you ruin the Lian family's reputation,

03:18.710 --> 03:20.150
how can my Xiu'er get married?

03:20.320 --> 03:21.780
I'm going to give you a beating today.

03:21.810 --> 03:22.850
Thanks to your mess,

03:23.390 --> 03:24.550
my Xiu'er

03:24.579 --> 03:25.860
won't be able to get married anymore.

03:25.980 --> 03:26.590
Mother.

03:26.700 --> 03:27.740
I'll kill you today!

03:27.980 --> 03:28.420
Mother!

03:28.540 --> 03:29.220
Stop hitting him.

03:29.650 --> 03:30.340
You worked hard.

03:30.579 --> 03:31.079
Thanks.

03:33.470 --> 03:34.800
Hit me if you want.

03:35.260 --> 03:36.660
Don't hurt Man'er anymore.

03:38.540 --> 03:39.500
I'll be honest with you.

03:40.100 --> 03:40.940
All of them

03:41.100 --> 03:42.420
know about me and Shen Nuo.

03:43.140 --> 03:44.620
They were afraid that I would ruin their reputation.

03:44.820 --> 03:46.340
That's why they're in such a hurry

03:46.340 --> 03:47.540
to marry me into the Sun family.

03:48.380 --> 03:49.660
How many betrothal gifts did the Sun family give?

03:49.810 --> 03:51.050
We'll return them all.

03:53.480 --> 03:54.320
That's not true.

03:54.579 --> 03:55.620
She made it up.

03:56.260 --> 03:57.450
Which girl

03:57.480 --> 03:59.560
would mess around with her innocence?

03:59.940 --> 04:00.850
I think

04:01.070 --> 04:02.630
you’d better spit out

04:03.080 --> 04:04.340
the 500 taels of silver.

04:05.380 --> 04:06.220
I

04:06.300 --> 04:08.270
will just view it

04:08.820 --> 04:09.910
as a waste of my time.

04:10.220 --> 04:11.340
Five hundred taels?

04:11.750 --> 04:12.900
That much silver?

04:13.460 --> 04:13.970
Uncle,

04:14.280 --> 04:16.620
you said you didn't sell me for a widow burning.

04:17.310 --> 04:18.560
In the village,

04:18.910 --> 04:20.680
getting 20 taels of silver in betrothal gifts

04:20.700 --> 04:22.140
is already very high for marriages.

04:23.460 --> 04:24.100
Shouren,

04:25.140 --> 04:27.130
Matchmaker Wang said 500 taels.

04:28.020 --> 04:28.780
What does this mean?

04:30.220 --> 04:30.780
Father,

04:31.530 --> 04:32.170
this...

04:32.659 --> 04:33.140
The Sun family

04:33.659 --> 04:36.580
did give us 500 taels of silver.

04:37.020 --> 04:37.580
However,

04:38.130 --> 04:38.900
the Sun family

04:39.260 --> 04:40.450
is a famous local elite

04:40.690 --> 04:43.090
of the Qingfeng County.

04:43.320 --> 04:44.300
It's not a big deal

04:44.330 --> 04:45.530
for them to offer 500 taels.

04:45.900 --> 04:46.580
I...

04:46.630 --> 04:48.210
Man'er is already going above her level

04:48.240 --> 04:49.620
to marry them.

04:49.990 --> 04:51.550
I have no selfish motives.

04:51.780 --> 04:53.460
It's all for Man'er's sake.

04:55.640 --> 04:57.090
The Sun family of Qingfeng County?

04:59.409 --> 05:00.730
Return the money.

05:01.680 --> 05:02.600
Send Matchmaker Wang away.

05:06.040 --> 05:07.060
Tell the Sun family

05:07.820 --> 05:08.700
that Man'er is not getting married anymore.

05:10.440 --> 05:11.960
Your granddaughter can't get married anyway

05:12.000 --> 05:13.680
and you think she's some kind of precious phoenix.

05:14.460 --> 05:15.660
Scholar Lian, let me tell you.

05:15.830 --> 05:17.270
Return the money to me.

05:17.460 --> 05:19.260
Otherwise, none of you will get away with it.

05:38.950 --> 05:39.710
I borrowed

05:40.340 --> 05:41.310
the child

05:41.340 --> 05:41.909
from this woman.

05:42.530 --> 05:43.620
She came all the way here.

05:44.020 --> 05:45.260
I should give her 50 coins in gratitude,

05:46.610 --> 05:48.050
but my family suffered from a flood

05:48.340 --> 05:49.130
and I don't have a penny to me.

05:50.250 --> 05:51.270
I hope you can pay the money.

05:54.720 --> 05:56.070
You little brat.

05:56.400 --> 05:57.600
How dare you lie to us!

05:58.460 --> 05:59.330
If

05:59.640 --> 06:00.830
she stays here for too long,

06:01.470 --> 06:03.150
she might hear something.

06:05.530 --> 06:06.900
Give her the money and send her away.

06:08.220 --> 06:09.020
Brat.

06:09.660 --> 06:11.170
You ruined

06:11.190 --> 06:12.870
Man'er's great marriage.

06:13.050 --> 06:14.250
I haven't even dealt with him yet,

06:14.270 --> 06:14.940
old man.

06:16.250 --> 06:17.020
Look at you.

06:17.700 --> 06:18.980
Instead, you're blackmailing us

06:19.580 --> 06:21.110
and asked us

06:21.140 --> 06:21.660
for 50 coins.

06:21.680 --> 06:23.480
I told you to give her the money.

06:26.150 --> 06:26.700
Move.

06:27.970 --> 06:29.330
Brat.

06:29.530 --> 06:30.720
You idiot.

06:39.700 --> 06:40.380
Grandpa,

06:41.550 --> 06:42.790
although this child is fake,

06:43.830 --> 06:44.790
my relationship with Man'er

06:44.820 --> 06:45.780
is true.

06:46.860 --> 06:47.790
After the flood,

06:48.380 --> 06:49.580
I'm the only survivor

06:49.610 --> 06:50.490
in my family.

06:52.020 --> 06:52.990
Please

06:53.330 --> 06:54.580
let me stay by Man'er's side.

06:56.909 --> 06:58.390
You want to live with our family?

06:58.780 --> 06:59.530
Grandpa,

06:59.860 --> 07:01.030
just let him stay.

07:02.140 --> 07:03.460
If not,

07:03.640 --> 07:05.760
he will sit outside the door every day.

07:06.140 --> 07:07.660
If the villagers passing by see him...

07:07.750 --> 07:08.390
Shut up!

07:14.640 --> 07:15.730
Let me think about it.

07:29.210 --> 07:29.700
Scram!

07:40.270 --> 07:41.070
Close the door.

07:50.470 --> 07:51.100
Father.

07:52.820 --> 07:53.880
There are no outsiders here.

07:54.260 --> 07:55.300
Tell me the truth.

07:55.320 --> 07:56.430
What exactly is the situation

07:56.460 --> 07:57.540
with the 500 taels of silver?

07:57.840 --> 07:59.080
This amount is more than

07:59.110 --> 07:59.750
what an ordinary family

07:59.780 --> 08:01.020
can make in a lifetime.

08:01.180 --> 08:02.310
Did you really sell Man'er

08:02.330 --> 08:03.210
for a widow burning?

08:03.240 --> 08:03.880
No, no.

08:04.380 --> 08:04.820
Father.

08:05.220 --> 08:05.930
I'm innocent.

08:06.220 --> 08:06.810
The Sun family

08:06.980 --> 08:09.100
was willing to pay

08:09.120 --> 08:09.870
the 500 taels of silver

08:09.900 --> 08:10.900
after they read Man'er's horoscope.

08:10.980 --> 08:11.700
The Sun family

08:11.700 --> 08:12.670
is extremely wealthy.

08:12.700 --> 08:14.090
They're willing to offer so much in betrothal gifts.

08:14.140 --> 08:14.920
I can't

08:15.220 --> 08:16.340
send it back like this.

08:16.930 --> 08:17.810
That's good.

08:19.020 --> 08:19.820
But

08:20.340 --> 08:21.650
you shouldn’t have

08:21.670 --> 08:23.550
kept the silver matter from us.

08:25.380 --> 08:25.980
Father,

08:26.700 --> 08:27.880
I did this

08:27.900 --> 08:29.470
for the sake of our family.

08:29.700 --> 08:30.430
The Sun family

08:30.490 --> 08:31.860
has a good relationship

08:32.299 --> 08:33.700
with the prefectural governor of Yun.

08:33.820 --> 08:35.520
If we become his in-laws,

08:35.690 --> 08:37.030
we'll have a chance of becoming an official too.

08:37.409 --> 08:38.299
Then we can change—

08:38.330 --> 08:39.179
Enough.

08:40.640 --> 08:42.230
Man'er had an affair with someone.

08:43.220 --> 08:44.340
Don't worry about

08:45.340 --> 08:46.220
her marriage anymore.

08:52.460 --> 08:53.240
Seven.

08:56.060 --> 08:56.580
Seven?

08:57.580 --> 08:58.180
Where is he?

08:59.330 --> 09:00.320
Man'er.

09:01.820 --> 09:02.740
You little brat.

09:03.140 --> 09:04.300
There was such a big commotion earlier.

09:04.340 --> 09:05.220
Why didn't you come check it out?

09:05.620 --> 09:06.740
Mom wouldn't let me.

09:07.460 --> 09:08.100
Just kidding.

09:09.220 --> 09:09.820
This is Shen Nuo.

09:10.500 --> 09:11.500
This is my brother, Seven.

09:21.970 --> 09:22.580
Shen Nuo.

09:24.180 --> 09:24.820
Shen Nuo.

09:25.990 --> 09:26.700
Why did he faint again?

09:28.180 --> 09:29.660
Where can I find a doctor for you?

09:30.340 --> 09:31.420
Man'er, find Brother Youheng.

09:33.250 --> 09:34.290
Brother Youheng?

09:42.000 --> 09:43.560
I don't think it's Brother Youheng.

09:44.360 --> 09:45.560
He looks more like Uncle Youheng to me.

09:52.660 --> 09:54.350
[Wang Youheng, the eldest son of the Wang family]

09:55.300 --> 09:55.820
Father.

09:56.340 --> 09:57.460
That's more like it.

09:59.500 --> 10:00.580
What's the most important thing

10:00.600 --> 10:01.560
about collecting interest?

10:04.700 --> 10:05.100
I don't know.

10:05.330 --> 10:05.970
Be ruthless.

10:07.900 --> 10:08.940
How can you collect debts if you're not ruthless?

10:11.300 --> 10:11.710
Come on.

10:13.860 --> 10:15.030
Show me

10:15.680 --> 10:16.410
a ruthless expression.

10:16.920 --> 10:17.400
Come on.

10:24.100 --> 10:25.220
You need the power.

10:26.090 --> 10:26.700
Be fierce.

10:32.500 --> 10:33.210
You won't pay up?

10:33.500 --> 10:34.150
Do you know the consequences

10:34.180 --> 10:35.180
of going back on your words?

10:36.300 --> 10:37.340
Break one of his fingers.

10:38.460 --> 10:38.930
Your turn.

10:51.340 --> 10:52.090
You won't pay up?

10:53.220 --> 10:53.700
Fine.

10:53.720 --> 10:54.450
It's not fine!

10:54.740 --> 10:55.220
No,

10:55.590 --> 10:56.930
are you allowing it?

10:57.030 --> 10:58.040
You're not forcing them to pay the debt.

10:58.390 --> 10:59.360
You have to be fierce. Come on.

11:00.100 --> 11:01.100
Shake your legs.

11:01.820 --> 11:02.700
Be tough.

11:02.860 --> 11:03.500
Shake your legs like this.

11:04.220 --> 11:04.940
Come on. Shake.

11:05.980 --> 11:06.580
Look at him.

11:07.740 --> 11:08.340
Point at him.

11:08.980 --> 11:10.020
Point with the sugar cane.

11:11.170 --> 11:12.580
Take a bite and spit it on his face.

11:18.920 --> 11:20.520
Watch where you're spitting.

11:20.950 --> 11:21.580
Spit on my face.

11:22.700 --> 11:23.220
Father,

11:23.580 --> 11:24.390
I don't think it's a good idea.

11:24.420 --> 11:25.290
Spit on my face.

11:29.330 --> 11:29.810
Who is it?

11:30.460 --> 11:31.360
Man'er, run!

11:33.290 --> 11:34.570
Stop! Stop!

11:36.300 --> 11:36.750
Don't move.

11:42.370 --> 11:43.050
Man'er,

11:43.700 --> 11:44.700
what are you doing there?

11:46.580 --> 11:48.450
I'm looking for Youheng.

11:49.440 --> 11:50.410
Then go inside. You...

11:50.550 --> 11:51.940
Why were you peeking through the fence?

11:52.640 --> 11:53.180
Hurry.

11:55.580 --> 11:58.060
Wait, aren't you going to marry

11:58.460 --> 11:59.860
into the Sun family in Qingfeng County today?

12:00.100 --> 12:00.980
Why are you still here?

12:02.100 --> 12:02.810
I broke off the engagement.

12:02.850 --> 12:03.700
I won't get married.

12:03.860 --> 12:04.340
You...

12:04.820 --> 12:05.500
Broke off the engagement?

12:07.060 --> 12:07.980
That's great.

12:08.540 --> 12:09.380
You can't get married.

12:09.780 --> 12:10.900
They wanted to marry our Man'er,

12:11.130 --> 12:11.960
but the Sun family

12:11.990 --> 12:13.240
didn't prepare any of the traditions.

12:13.460 --> 12:14.310
They just sent a matchmaker

12:14.340 --> 12:15.180
to come pick you up.

12:15.740 --> 12:16.940
What kind of marriage is this?

12:16.970 --> 12:18.460
-If my Youheng marries...
-Man'er.

12:20.940 --> 12:21.620
How come you're here?

12:25.060 --> 12:26.330
I'm going to collect a debt now.

12:26.980 --> 12:27.860
She broke off the engagement.

12:29.960 --> 12:30.980
Okay, you two talk.

12:33.680 --> 12:34.690
Break his finger first.

12:40.000 --> 12:40.800
And then we'll talk.

12:45.590 --> 12:46.990
How long has your father been like this?

12:55.700 --> 12:56.700
Young Master Shen,

12:57.700 --> 12:58.820
how did you get poisoned?

13:02.100 --> 13:02.980
I ran into bandits

13:03.980 --> 13:04.860
and fought desperately for my life.

13:05.340 --> 13:06.460
The bandits hurt me.

13:09.340 --> 13:10.100
I see.

13:12.180 --> 13:12.980
I'll use acupuncture

13:13.220 --> 13:14.330
to force the poison out of you first.

13:21.820 --> 13:22.980
I haven't used needles on real people in a long while.

13:31.860 --> 13:32.420
Shen Nuo,

13:32.770 --> 13:33.670
it's fortunate you brought our child

13:33.700 --> 13:34.340
here.

13:38.620 --> 13:39.460
Shen, please forgive me.

13:40.220 --> 13:40.920
How about you find

13:40.940 --> 13:42.110
an experienced doctor instead?

13:43.100 --> 13:44.030
I made a mistake just now.

13:44.220 --> 13:45.340
It won't happen again.

13:46.620 --> 13:47.620
It's good enough to have Youheng.

13:48.220 --> 13:48.840
Go on.

13:53.420 --> 13:54.210
Be careful.

13:58.360 --> 13:59.470
With that baby,

13:59.640 --> 14:00.640
the matchmaker immediately believed our story.

14:01.240 --> 14:02.410
The matter of the 500 taels of silver

14:02.580 --> 14:03.660
was exposed quickly.

14:04.100 --> 14:05.030
Thank you, Young Master Shen

14:05.220 --> 14:06.270
for solving my crisis

14:06.290 --> 14:07.030
so easily.

14:07.550 --> 14:08.900
The mutual help was a success this time.

14:09.270 --> 14:10.350
My grandpa definitely won't want you

14:10.420 --> 14:11.150
to sit outside the door every day

14:11.180 --> 14:11.940
and get gossiped about.

14:12.460 --> 14:13.270
You can stay here now.

14:15.980 --> 14:17.060
Shen is going to live here?

14:18.100 --> 14:18.760
We agreed to it.

14:18.860 --> 14:19.520
It's mutually beneficial.

14:24.490 --> 14:25.270
Shen,

14:26.000 --> 14:26.920
take a good rest.

14:27.340 --> 14:27.940
Man'er,

14:28.420 --> 14:29.280
let's go out first.

14:29.590 --> 14:30.820
We shouldn't disturb Young Master Shen.

14:39.910 --> 14:40.810
I’m leaving then.

15:04.390 --> 15:05.300
He's already dead

15:06.050 --> 15:07.520
and they want people to be buried alive with him.

15:12.580 --> 15:13.180
Aunt Zhang.

15:13.940 --> 15:16.110
I heard you fainted just now.

15:16.630 --> 15:17.550
Are you feeling better?

15:18.940 --> 15:19.460
I'm okay.

15:22.220 --> 15:23.530
Man'er told me

15:23.580 --> 15:24.460
about you.

15:25.460 --> 15:26.150
I know

15:26.460 --> 15:28.060
your family suffered from a flood

15:28.340 --> 15:30.100
and you ran into Man'er while fleeing.

15:30.510 --> 15:32.720
Now, you plan on staying with the Lian family

15:32.750 --> 15:33.750
for a few days.

15:39.840 --> 15:40.820
There's no one around now.

15:41.340 --> 15:42.100
What do you want to say?

15:42.420 --> 15:43.220
Say it here.

15:44.460 --> 15:45.340
As far as I know,

15:46.170 --> 15:47.660
the Shen Village in Qingshan County

15:47.820 --> 15:49.220
indeed had a flood this year,

15:50.300 --> 15:51.500
but that area is mostly inhabited by farmers.

15:52.240 --> 15:53.110
Shen Nuo

15:53.470 --> 15:55.070
doesn’t look like a laborer.

15:56.060 --> 15:57.060
The calluses on his palms

15:57.340 --> 15:58.460
are not from holding a hoe.

15:59.180 --> 16:00.680
Instead, they seem to be from holding weapons.

16:01.820 --> 16:03.980
He said he was poisoned by bandits

16:04.160 --> 16:05.270
and that's why he fainted in the mountains.

16:05.880 --> 16:07.360
Bandits usually use sedatives.

16:07.820 --> 16:08.950
The poison remnants in his body

16:08.980 --> 16:09.670
are clearly from the qianji poison

16:09.700 --> 16:10.620
used commonly by constables.

16:11.700 --> 16:12.460
Could it be

16:12.740 --> 16:13.700
that he's the bandit?

16:14.580 --> 16:15.250
Could it be

16:15.340 --> 16:16.280
he's from a rich family

16:16.300 --> 16:17.420
in their village?

16:17.450 --> 16:19.140
Those rich boys just practice martial arts

16:19.170 --> 16:19.700
and play with pet birds all day.

16:19.980 --> 16:20.980
They don't have to work in the fields,

16:20.980 --> 16:22.180
so that's why he doesn't have calluses.

16:22.820 --> 16:23.340
Man'er,

16:23.980 --> 16:25.420
we aren't clear about his background.

16:25.880 --> 16:26.910
What if you keep him in your home

16:27.470 --> 16:28.580
and he brings danger to you?

16:28.940 --> 16:29.740
Man'er's grandpa

16:29.740 --> 16:30.970
has agreed for you to stay.

16:32.420 --> 16:33.220
He also

16:34.510 --> 16:35.640
wants you to marry into our family.

16:36.980 --> 16:37.820
I wonder

16:39.230 --> 16:40.510
if you are willing to do so.

16:46.140 --> 16:47.260
How about from now on,

16:48.050 --> 16:49.640
I'll be your distant nephew

16:50.180 --> 16:51.190
and no longer be someone who had a private affair

16:51.220 --> 16:51.980
with Lian Man'er?

16:52.460 --> 16:53.620
That farce just now

16:54.180 --> 16:55.740
was just a desperate solution.

16:56.500 --> 16:57.620
What do you think, Aunt Zhang?

17:01.850 --> 17:03.180
I will explain it

17:03.720 --> 17:05.930
to my family and grandparents.

17:07.339 --> 17:08.050
But

17:08.859 --> 17:09.980
if Grandma knows

17:10.890 --> 17:12.460
that you are just my nephew,

17:13.740 --> 17:15.349
I don't know if you'll be accepted anymore.

17:20.520 --> 17:21.119
Man'er.

17:21.260 --> 17:21.980
I know.

17:22.220 --> 17:23.540
The less trouble, the better.

17:24.180 --> 17:25.700
It's just that it's inappropriate

17:25.980 --> 17:26.900
to drive him away

17:27.619 --> 17:28.860
right after he helped me with my crisis.

17:30.460 --> 17:31.590
Besides, Shen Nuo

17:31.690 --> 17:32.490
made my grandma

17:32.510 --> 17:33.620
so angry today.

17:34.060 --> 17:34.820
He made my grandma

17:34.860 --> 17:35.740
spend dozens of coins today.

17:37.940 --> 17:38.620
Don't worry.

17:39.060 --> 17:40.020
Even if I don't do anything,

17:40.180 --> 17:41.840
my grandma will definitely drive him away.

17:49.450 --> 17:50.730
Eat slowly.

17:53.610 --> 17:55.320
You ground wild musk maple into powder

17:56.060 --> 17:57.740
and used oranges as flavoring and hawthorn as the spice.

17:58.250 --> 17:59.350
It's such an honor

17:59.380 --> 18:00.120
to be able to eat

18:00.300 --> 18:01.020
Grandma Lian's desserts today.

18:01.260 --> 18:02.980
I believe even the food in the palace

18:03.220 --> 18:04.160
are not as delicious

18:04.180 --> 18:05.340
as your homemade delicacies.

18:06.880 --> 18:09.250
The roasted pork belly I made for you

18:09.460 --> 18:10.620
will be ready soon.

18:10.620 --> 18:11.700
You can eat it.

18:12.590 --> 18:13.370
Grandma Lian,

18:14.180 --> 18:15.460
although I haven't been here for long,

18:16.060 --> 18:17.220
but I've already noticed some things.

18:17.440 --> 18:18.870
The Lian family has many descendants,

18:18.910 --> 18:20.030
but you are the only one

18:20.050 --> 18:21.500
taking care of them all.

18:21.780 --> 18:22.980
It must be hard on you.

18:23.660 --> 18:25.000
Exactly.

18:25.850 --> 18:27.980
They don't know how hard it is as the head of the family.

18:28.020 --> 18:29.460
I have to scrimp and save

18:29.500 --> 18:30.300
on myself

18:30.340 --> 18:31.770
to afford the food and water

18:31.770 --> 18:33.260
and everything else for this family.

18:33.700 --> 18:35.220
They all think that I'm rude,

18:35.300 --> 18:36.460
have a bad temper,

18:36.580 --> 18:38.060
and am unreasonable.

18:38.700 --> 18:39.680
If I were nice,

18:39.830 --> 18:41.160
they wouldn't listen to me.

18:41.420 --> 18:42.300
None of them

18:42.380 --> 18:43.900
are easy to deal with.

18:44.260 --> 18:46.180
You are so thoughtful and have foresight.

18:46.540 --> 18:48.060
You must have suffered a lot

18:48.700 --> 18:50.120
as a young daughter-in-law.

18:51.100 --> 18:52.830
I've been married for 40 years now.

18:53.220 --> 18:54.940
I've suffered more

18:55.830 --> 18:57.080
than all of them.

18:57.700 --> 18:58.440
Really.

19:01.460 --> 19:02.390
You silly girl.

19:02.420 --> 19:03.800
All you do is eat.

19:04.020 --> 19:05.430
Go sweep the yard.

19:05.570 --> 19:06.760
Sweep the yard!

19:07.220 --> 19:07.980
Man'er,

19:08.700 --> 19:09.700
hurry and go sweep.

19:10.180 --> 19:10.630
You...

19:17.260 --> 19:18.380
Here, eat this.

19:18.540 --> 19:19.220
Okay, I'll try it.

19:22.420 --> 19:23.660
It's sweet.

19:23.690 --> 19:24.110
Is it good?

19:24.130 --> 19:25.120
He's outrageous.

19:26.210 --> 19:27.050
It's delicious.

19:28.290 --> 19:29.390
His tricks

19:29.780 --> 19:30.760
can only deceive ignorant women

19:30.790 --> 19:31.990
like my grandma.

19:33.180 --> 19:34.170
Grandpa

19:34.870 --> 19:36.390
would never be fooled by him.

19:37.880 --> 19:38.820
Grandpa,

19:38.850 --> 19:39.840
I heard that you came from a poor family,

19:40.420 --> 19:41.700
but you became a boss in the end.

19:42.250 --> 19:43.570
I really admire you.

19:44.530 --> 19:45.610
Not at all.

19:46.220 --> 19:48.540
The social rankings are scholars, farmers, artisans, and merchants,

19:49.200 --> 19:50.400
but it's near impossible

19:50.850 --> 19:52.060
to find a farmer

19:52.090 --> 19:53.110
within a thousand-mile radius

19:53.330 --> 19:54.270
who can enter the restaurant business

19:54.300 --> 19:55.300
and succeed.

19:56.220 --> 19:57.540
It's just a small matter.

19:57.840 --> 19:59.080
Forget it.

20:01.520 --> 20:02.950
At that time,

20:03.220 --> 20:04.180
the whole street

20:04.340 --> 20:05.580
knew who

20:06.140 --> 20:07.860
Master Lian was.

20:07.890 --> 20:08.830
That's amazing.

20:08.870 --> 20:10.740
It's all in the past.

20:11.300 --> 20:13.190
I can't do that anymore.

20:13.220 --> 20:15.890
[Zhang Chengcai, the eldest son of the Zhang family]

20:17.950 --> 20:20.730
[Zhao Liang, the third son of the Zhao family]

20:20.750 --> 20:22.160
What are these?

20:31.070 --> 20:32.700
[Chen Ji, the second son of the Chen family]

20:31.210 --> 20:32.170
What are you looking at?

20:34.020 --> 20:35.220
Hua'er brought them for me.

20:36.100 --> 20:37.970
These young masters from the city

20:38.220 --> 20:39.220
all have great family backgrounds,

20:39.460 --> 20:41.220
but their appearances

20:41.930 --> 20:43.410
are not even as handsome as Shen Nuo.

20:45.220 --> 20:47.700
You are my only daughter.

20:48.980 --> 20:51.300
I will definitely find you a good husband.

20:53.260 --> 20:54.120
But, Mother,

20:54.720 --> 20:56.080
Hua'er is going to

20:56.100 --> 20:57.300
marry into the Song family this year.

20:58.260 --> 20:59.700
When can I get married?

21:00.300 --> 21:01.980
You are one year younger than her.

21:02.700 --> 21:03.500
We're not in a hurry.

21:05.380 --> 21:06.300
How about

21:06.610 --> 21:07.610
we go to the temple tomorrow

21:07.820 --> 21:08.710
and ask them to calculate it again?

21:08.750 --> 21:10.120
Fine, I'll do as you say.

21:17.040 --> 21:18.820
Isn't this from Aunt Zhang's dowry?

21:20.340 --> 21:21.730
She usually doesn't bear to take it out.

21:21.980 --> 21:23.020
Why is it in your hands?

21:24.980 --> 21:25.980
She begged me

21:26.140 --> 21:27.590
to take in her nephew, Shen Nuo.

21:28.080 --> 21:29.680
I wouldn't have agreed

21:29.710 --> 21:30.930
if she didn't take out her dowry.

21:31.140 --> 21:31.980
My mother is the best.

21:34.460 --> 21:36.140
My daughter looks good in anything.

21:44.420 --> 21:44.980
Sir,

21:45.450 --> 21:48.340
why don't we send Lian Ye'er over?

21:48.740 --> 21:49.780
Nonsense.

21:50.780 --> 21:51.780
How could the Sun family

21:52.220 --> 21:52.780
think highly

21:52.780 --> 21:54.550
of Lian Ye'er?

21:55.300 --> 21:56.800
Besides, they are not compatible.

21:57.020 --> 21:57.830
If the old man finds out,

21:57.860 --> 21:59.040
he might not agree either.

21:59.610 --> 22:01.300
Then what should we do?

22:01.500 --> 22:01.980
Father!

22:02.420 --> 22:03.220
Father! Mother!

22:03.560 --> 22:05.160
We were all fooled.

22:05.620 --> 22:06.220
What?

22:06.250 --> 22:07.660
That man.

22:07.770 --> 22:08.540
He's not

22:08.570 --> 22:09.610
Lian Man'er's lover at all.

22:10.180 --> 22:11.860
He's Aunt Zhang's distant nephew.

22:11.980 --> 22:13.090
She brought him here

22:13.120 --> 22:14.340
to block Lian Man'er's engagement.

22:16.380 --> 22:16.860
Really?

22:16.880 --> 22:18.490
Aunt Zhang told Grandma herself.

22:25.700 --> 22:26.580
Return the money?

22:27.260 --> 22:28.540
The Sun family doesn't care about this money.

22:29.490 --> 22:31.030
Doesn't Lian Shouren have a daughter

22:31.060 --> 22:32.020
named Lian Hua'er?

22:32.500 --> 22:33.970
If Lian Man'er can't get married,

22:34.180 --> 22:35.300
just have Lian Hua'er take her place.

22:35.860 --> 22:37.470
Lian Hua'er is Lian Shouren's

22:37.500 --> 22:38.300
biological daughter.

22:38.810 --> 22:39.640
Is he willing

22:39.940 --> 22:41.460
to let his daughter die?

22:43.180 --> 22:44.460
He's just a scholar.

22:44.750 --> 22:45.730
It's not up to him.

22:47.050 --> 22:48.460
Since he took the money,

22:48.940 --> 22:50.500
he must hand someone over.

22:50.970 --> 22:51.850
If he refuses,

22:52.700 --> 22:54.500
we can kidnap Lian Hua'er if we must.

22:55.300 --> 22:56.230
Housekeeper Sun, calm down.

22:57.380 --> 22:58.460
The person who broke the contract is here.

22:59.990 --> 23:01.390
Housekeeper Sun, there's something you don't know.

23:01.880 --> 23:02.640
Lian Man'er

23:02.770 --> 23:04.100
didn't have an affair with anyone

23:04.120 --> 23:05.150
nor does she have a child.

23:05.600 --> 23:06.840
It was all an act

23:07.050 --> 23:08.590
that she asked someone to put on with her.

23:09.420 --> 23:09.980
Lian Man'er

23:10.340 --> 23:11.580
is still a virgin.

23:16.840 --> 23:18.220
If you don't believe me,

23:18.500 --> 23:18.970
then

23:19.260 --> 23:20.120
send a midwife over

23:20.150 --> 23:21.350
to verify her body.

23:22.780 --> 23:23.620
But...

23:24.460 --> 23:25.780
But this girl

23:26.100 --> 23:27.140
has been very noisy lately.

23:27.420 --> 23:28.500
She has many tricks up her sleeve.

23:29.020 --> 23:30.380
She is probably

23:31.420 --> 23:32.900
still unwilling to get married.

23:43.840 --> 23:44.900
In that case,

23:45.650 --> 23:46.780
you must stabilize the Lian family.

23:48.230 --> 23:49.910
I'll find a way to take her away.

24:08.860 --> 24:09.540
Halt.

24:11.020 --> 24:11.820
Where are you going?

24:15.060 --> 24:15.740
Where am I going?

24:16.740 --> 24:17.950
Is this a place for humans to live in?

24:18.500 --> 24:19.090
Why are you insulting me?

24:19.110 --> 24:19.790
I've lived here before.

24:22.220 --> 24:24.060
Although you've won over everyone in the family,

24:24.460 --> 24:25.260
the Lian family

24:25.260 --> 24:25.980
has limited wealth.

24:26.310 --> 24:27.790
You can't keep living in my room either.

24:28.700 --> 24:29.290
So,

24:29.770 --> 24:30.740
you can move here.

24:31.450 --> 24:32.430
I can

24:32.450 --> 24:33.810
give you a discount too.

24:34.280 --> 24:35.040
One hundred coins

24:35.610 --> 24:36.420
per day.

24:38.620 --> 24:39.420
You're charging me

24:39.460 --> 24:40.340
for such a shabby house?

24:40.370 --> 24:41.080
Of course.

24:41.580 --> 24:42.820
You're eating my food and living in my house.

24:43.660 --> 24:44.730
In order to

24:44.750 --> 24:45.750
to let you stay,

24:45.990 --> 24:47.460
your aunt even paid a hairpin from her dowry.

24:48.090 --> 24:49.770
All of these have a price to them.

24:50.860 --> 24:52.960
You don't have money now,

24:53.540 --> 24:54.460
so I'll just record it.

25:07.600 --> 25:08.920
You're the first woman I've seen

25:08.950 --> 25:09.890
who is obsessed with money

25:10.180 --> 25:11.550
and is shameless about it too.

25:12.020 --> 25:12.620
Thank you.

25:13.620 --> 25:14.560
Aren't you afraid I'll go back on my word?

25:14.970 --> 25:15.950
Whatever.

25:16.100 --> 25:17.380
I'll accept that I trusted the wrong person.

25:18.420 --> 25:19.020
Anyway,

25:19.020 --> 25:21.000
I'm not going to use you to make a fortune.

25:21.030 --> 25:23.950
[Board 1]

25:21.030 --> 25:23.950
[One hairpin, two taels]

25:25.190 --> 25:25.800
You're leaving?

25:26.230 --> 25:27.170
Your grandma told you

25:27.190 --> 25:28.190
to clean the house for me.

25:29.740 --> 25:31.230
You're an able-bodied man.

25:31.250 --> 25:31.730
What's wrong?

25:32.140 --> 25:33.310
You only know how to talk

25:33.330 --> 25:34.390
and kiss up to the old woman,

25:34.550 --> 25:35.590
but you don't know how to work?

25:38.170 --> 25:39.370
I haven't recovered yet

25:40.670 --> 25:42.160
and I got hit by your grandma too.

25:42.590 --> 25:43.340
Now,

25:44.430 --> 25:45.870
I can't even lift a bowl.

26:12.790 --> 26:14.060
I thought you couldn't even lift a cup?

26:15.860 --> 26:16.880
I just took a break

26:16.900 --> 26:17.830
and saved up some energy.

26:18.700 --> 26:19.290
Do you want some water?

26:19.320 --> 26:19.710
You...

26:28.210 --> 26:29.650
[Cleaning]

26:32.920 --> 26:33.460
Seven.

26:34.040 --> 26:36.180
[Cleaning, one tael]

26:52.970 --> 26:54.610
[New location unlocked]

26:52.970 --> 26:54.610
[Jinyang County]

26:54.630 --> 26:55.870
Have a look.

26:55.900 --> 26:57.880
Fresh fruits and vegetables!

26:57.910 --> 26:59.110
Ladies and gentlemen,

26:59.140 --> 27:00.380
Support us with money if you can

27:00.420 --> 27:01.380
Candied haw!

27:02.220 --> 27:03.460
Have a look.

27:03.460 --> 27:04.780
Fresh wontons.

27:08.020 --> 27:09.560
Stir-fried chestnuts with sugar.

27:13.970 --> 27:15.710
There are so many delicacies in the ancient times.

27:16.880 --> 27:18.560
Why don't I find a way

27:18.580 --> 27:19.650
to make money with food?

27:20.460 --> 27:21.700
Awesome.

27:21.970 --> 27:23.130
Support us with money if you can

27:23.150 --> 27:24.110
or give your moral support.

27:27.890 --> 27:28.530
Okay.

27:30.340 --> 27:31.510
Nine out of ten farm novels

27:31.540 --> 27:32.420
talk about pig offals.

27:32.940 --> 27:34.090
This is the secret

27:34.120 --> 27:35.660
of getting rich in farm novels.

27:37.630 --> 27:38.140
Sir,

27:38.340 --> 27:39.030
can you give me

27:39.060 --> 27:39.940
all of the pig offals?

27:40.060 --> 27:40.580
Okay.

27:43.550 --> 27:44.230
I need to pay?

27:46.860 --> 27:48.280
I thought you don't eat this.

27:48.460 --> 27:49.860
Who said we don't eat it?

27:50.420 --> 27:50.920
Look.

27:51.700 --> 27:52.320
Sir,

27:52.540 --> 27:53.610
freshly cooked pork belly soup.

27:53.640 --> 27:54.240
Would you like one?

27:56.210 --> 27:57.450
It'll be ready soon.

27:57.780 --> 27:59.700
Stir-fried pork waist and pork belly.

28:01.140 --> 28:01.780
Here comes the pork waist.

28:01.890 --> 28:02.620
It's ready to be served.

28:03.180 --> 28:04.020
Please enjoy.

28:04.020 --> 28:04.620
It's so long.

28:05.060 --> 28:07.210
Freshly cooked pork belly soup.

28:09.500 --> 28:11.300
It turns out that novels are full of lies.

28:12.620 --> 28:13.140
Seven,

28:13.420 --> 28:14.080
do you know

28:14.100 --> 28:15.270
where Youheng's clinic is?

28:20.320 --> 28:22.220
When the cold visits,

28:23.700 --> 28:25.940
it makes every hair stand up.

28:26.500 --> 28:28.420
When the cold attacks one's lungs,

28:28.620 --> 28:30.460
one must be prescribed...

28:32.700 --> 28:34.070
Three grams of tri-thin evodia,

28:34.220 --> 28:35.220
three grams of nona-orange jasmine,

28:35.540 --> 28:36.550
one gram of rough-leaved holly,

28:36.980 --> 28:38.140
and one gram of yellow flowered blackjack.

28:39.730 --> 28:40.920
Is my medicine ready?

28:43.130 --> 28:44.980
Your kidney is weak.

28:45.350 --> 28:46.640
You need to replenish your kidney.

28:47.340 --> 28:48.540
Prescribe...

28:51.220 --> 28:52.570
One gram of vinegar,

28:52.780 --> 28:54.030
two grams of cornelian cherry,

28:54.300 --> 28:55.160
one gram of poria,

28:55.220 --> 28:56.220
and one gram of peony root bark.

28:56.860 --> 28:57.270
Here.

29:08.160 --> 29:09.090
Your blood is clogged.

29:09.700 --> 29:10.650
You need to promote blood circulation

29:10.980 --> 29:11.790
and invigorate your heart.

29:12.020 --> 29:12.740
You can choose

29:13.310 --> 29:14.500
the Blood Mansion Dispelling Stasis Decoction

29:14.740 --> 29:16.070
to dispel stasis, promote circulation,

29:16.330 --> 29:16.890
dissolve phlegm,

29:17.060 --> 29:17.660
and dissipate the cold.

29:17.860 --> 29:18.380
That's it.

29:18.740 --> 29:21.460
Even your accountant apprentice knows medicine.

29:21.670 --> 29:23.110
You're indeed

29:23.170 --> 29:24.610
the top clinic in our village.

29:24.250 --> 29:27.230
[Healing the World]

29:28.370 --> 29:29.290
Youheng.

29:29.700 --> 29:30.320
Seven?

29:30.700 --> 29:31.380
Why are you here?

29:31.620 --> 29:32.180
Youheng

29:33.700 --> 29:34.420
Youheng.

29:34.900 --> 29:35.380
Man'er.

29:37.110 --> 29:38.810
You're working as an accountant in the clinic?

29:39.950 --> 29:41.480
My father wouldn't allow me to study medicine.

29:41.680 --> 29:42.760
I could only lie to him

29:42.780 --> 29:44.090
by working as an accountant in the clinic.

29:45.260 --> 29:46.770
Recently, I've been studying

29:46.790 --> 29:48.080
the standard prescriptions for common illnesses.

29:48.370 --> 29:48.940
This way,

29:49.050 --> 29:50.290
the poor ordinary folks

29:50.310 --> 29:51.320
can save some medical expenses.

29:51.700 --> 29:52.460
They just have to keep some herbs

29:52.490 --> 29:53.160
at home.

29:53.540 --> 29:54.030
Look.

29:54.350 --> 29:55.310
This is patent medicine.

29:55.700 --> 29:56.980
I found this prescription

29:57.080 --> 29:58.720
to be very effective for the normal cold,

29:59.540 --> 30:01.430
but I don't know what to call it.

30:02.500 --> 30:04.630
Three grams of tri-thin evodia

30:04.980 --> 30:06.540
and three grams of nona-orange jasmine.

30:09.680 --> 30:11.360
Three-nine...

30:12.260 --> 30:13.050
Cold medicine.
(Note: this is the name of a modern cold medicine)

30:13.700 --> 30:14.270
How is it?

30:15.260 --> 30:16.260
What do you mean?

30:17.290 --> 30:19.520
I just thought of it.

30:22.550 --> 30:23.580
Why are you here

30:23.660 --> 30:24.540
to see me?

30:25.380 --> 30:26.620
I just wanted to ask you

30:26.750 --> 30:28.080
if there are any herbs

30:28.110 --> 30:29.310
that I can dig out and sell to the clinic.

30:30.900 --> 30:31.860
The clinic

30:31.880 --> 30:33.360
often accepts firethorn from the mountains,

30:33.590 --> 30:34.990
but the price isn't high.

30:35.060 --> 30:36.460
Half a kilogram is only five coins.

30:37.780 --> 30:38.770
Even a penny is money.

30:39.290 --> 30:40.090
I'll go up the mountain now.

30:40.300 --> 30:41.170
Me too.

30:41.420 --> 30:42.420
Seven, don't go.

30:42.870 --> 30:43.870
I recently heard

30:43.890 --> 30:44.620
that there are bandits in the mountains.

30:44.870 --> 30:45.870
I'll go with your sister.

30:46.360 --> 30:47.900
You are too cautious.

30:48.140 --> 30:48.980
We won't be that unlucky

30:49.010 --> 30:49.710
to run into bandits.

30:53.450 --> 30:54.600
We really are unlucky.

31:01.020 --> 31:01.960
You've stopped the wrong people.

31:02.210 --> 31:03.170
We don't have money.

31:03.860 --> 31:04.630
We're right.

31:04.980 --> 31:05.780
The one we're kidnapping

31:06.170 --> 31:06.650
is you.

31:11.150 --> 31:11.990
You're from the Sun family.

31:14.300 --> 31:15.780
Miss Man'er, you're smart indeed.

31:16.110 --> 31:17.920
No wonder you tricked Matchmaker Wang and the others.

31:18.540 --> 31:20.310
I advise you to surrender

31:20.660 --> 31:21.780
and avoid hurting you

31:22.170 --> 31:22.980
and this young man

31:23.010 --> 31:24.660
with our weapons.

31:25.060 --> 31:26.540
Let's stop using violence

31:27.010 --> 31:28.260
and talk it out instead.

31:28.620 --> 31:29.270
At worst,

31:29.450 --> 31:30.420
we won't fight back.

31:30.900 --> 31:31.510
Man'er.

31:31.660 --> 31:32.120
Don't resist.

31:32.140 --> 31:32.840
Listen to me.

31:33.850 --> 31:35.450
Miss Man'er is quite sensible.

31:35.740 --> 31:36.780
As long as you come with us,

31:37.140 --> 31:38.070
I promise

31:38.420 --> 31:39.270
we won't hurt

31:39.300 --> 31:40.490
this young man at all.

31:44.620 --> 31:45.700
My wrist hurts.

31:45.970 --> 31:47.320
Tie it gently.

32:04.180 --> 32:04.660
Housekeeper Sun.

32:04.680 --> 32:05.750
-My eyes.
-Are you okay?

32:08.740 --> 32:09.780
Go after them!

32:11.530 --> 32:12.770
Stop! Don't run!

32:13.810 --> 32:14.330
Halt.

32:22.590 --> 32:23.100
Halt.

32:36.500 --> 32:37.280
Where are they?

32:44.790 --> 32:45.510
Did you two

32:45.670 --> 32:46.360
see them?

32:51.200 --> 32:52.530
Is itchiness contagious?

32:53.540 --> 32:54.300
Watching them scratch themselves,

32:54.600 --> 32:55.730
I feel itchy too.

32:57.810 --> 32:59.050
The vine patch we just passed by

32:59.740 --> 33:00.730
was full of thorns.

33:01.220 --> 33:02.050
If it touches you,

33:02.260 --> 33:03.380
it will make you incredibly itchy.

33:03.850 --> 33:04.420
In less than 15 minutes,

33:05.220 --> 33:06.460
your body will be covered with rashes.

33:07.500 --> 33:08.250
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

33:08.780 --> 33:09.620
You did it on purpose.

33:11.540 --> 33:12.620
I won't let anything happen to you.

33:13.500 --> 33:14.060
What is this?

33:14.420 --> 33:14.940
An antidote.

33:14.970 --> 33:15.360
Okay.

33:16.590 --> 33:17.480
When did you get this?

33:17.980 --> 33:19.660
Everything in the world that repels each other can live in harmony too.

33:20.260 --> 33:21.220
If you want to find an antidote,

33:21.620 --> 33:23.020
you must go to the place where the poison grows.

33:23.700 --> 33:24.760
I picked this offhandedly

33:24.890 --> 33:25.790
when we passed by the vines.

33:26.320 --> 33:27.480
I thought antidotes

33:27.500 --> 33:28.580
grew on the side of cliffs.

33:31.460 --> 33:32.210
Youeng, you're awesome.

33:33.660 --> 33:35.460
I think something is wrong.

33:35.740 --> 33:36.210
How about

33:36.610 --> 33:37.630
we go back?

33:40.300 --> 33:40.820
Let's go.

33:49.780 --> 33:50.630
The Sun family

33:50.920 --> 33:52.140
is working so hard to get a wife

33:52.620 --> 33:53.580
for their dead son.

33:54.980 --> 33:56.860
Why can't they send down a paper effigy?

33:57.140 --> 33:57.850
It's cheaper too.

33:58.220 --> 33:59.530
Why must you pick a living person?

33:59.830 --> 34:00.630
Judging from the situation,

34:01.940 --> 34:02.590
I don't think

34:02.620 --> 34:03.730
they'll give up easily.

34:07.890 --> 34:09.080
Has Shen Nuo left the Lian family?

34:09.670 --> 34:10.449
Don't mention it.

34:11.780 --> 34:12.300
I don't know

34:12.320 --> 34:13.380
how that guy

34:13.460 --> 34:14.219
managed to win over my grandma.

34:14.260 --> 34:15.100
She smiles at him so happily.

34:15.290 --> 34:16.469
Now, my status at home

34:16.500 --> 34:17.460
is even lower than him.

34:17.800 --> 34:19.000
I might have to leave before him.

34:19.520 --> 34:20.710
He also promised my mother

34:21.080 --> 34:22.070
that from now on,

34:22.100 --> 34:23.580
he's no longer someone who had an affair with me.

34:23.820 --> 34:25.270
He wants to live here

34:25.300 --> 34:25.980
as my mother's nephew.

34:28.060 --> 34:30.429
There must be a reason

34:30.460 --> 34:31.460
why Shen Nuo is insisting on staying here.

34:32.460 --> 34:33.460
It's good to let him stay.

34:34.300 --> 34:36.060
Let's see what he wants.

35:24.100 --> 35:24.860
Don't just stand there.

35:24.880 --> 35:25.550
Keep practicing.

35:32.520 --> 35:33.950
[Thirteen]

36:09.020 --> 36:10.580
The sun is almost setting.

36:10.860 --> 36:12.340
Why isn't Lian Man'er back yet?

36:12.860 --> 36:13.470
Lian Ye'er was the one

36:13.500 --> 36:14.580
who brought the ducks back today.

36:14.980 --> 36:15.860
Who knows where that girl

36:15.900 --> 36:17.060
is slacking off at again.

36:19.380 --> 36:21.100
Maybe she's chatting in someone's house

36:22.270 --> 36:23.780
like Aunt He.

36:24.980 --> 36:25.780
The melon is ready.

36:25.840 --> 36:27.500
Why were you so slow this time?

36:27.630 --> 36:28.800
Go to my mother's room.

36:28.850 --> 36:30.060
Get some mugwort, light it, bring it over.

36:31.090 --> 36:31.610
Go.

36:40.980 --> 36:41.660
Lian Man'er.

36:43.180 --> 36:44.340
Hua'er, you're eating melons?

36:45.400 --> 36:46.270
Why do you look

36:46.290 --> 36:47.500
so surprised to see me?

36:48.900 --> 36:50.180
Are you waiting for the Sun family

36:50.210 --> 36:50.810
to come and tell you,

36:51.420 --> 36:52.980
"Thank you for the clues you provided.

36:53.200 --> 36:54.500
We have caught Lian Man'er.

36:54.820 --> 36:55.710
You don't have to pay back

36:55.740 --> 36:56.500
the 500 taels of silver."

36:57.180 --> 36:58.180
I don't know what you're talking about.

36:58.740 --> 36:59.980
Hua'er is pure and kind.

37:00.000 --> 37:01.280
How could you say that about her?

37:01.580 --> 37:02.460
Give me the melon.

37:03.500 --> 37:04.580
She's pure and kind?

37:06.120 --> 37:06.600
Yes.

37:07.070 --> 37:08.290
What a beautiful,

37:08.310 --> 37:09.380
pure white lotus.

37:09.780 --> 37:10.730
I'm glad you know.

37:10.900 --> 37:11.940
Our Hua'er indeed

37:11.970 --> 37:13.340
has the character of a white lotus.

37:14.650 --> 37:15.600
What are you laughing at?

37:16.320 --> 37:17.480
I'm laughing at you.

37:17.800 --> 37:19.370
You don't even know that I'm making fun of you two.

37:20.450 --> 37:20.980
Hua'er,

37:21.250 --> 37:22.680
it's a pity that you can't be an actor.

37:24.020 --> 37:25.270
How dare you say

37:25.300 --> 37:26.370
Hua'er is like a clown?

37:26.860 --> 37:27.290
I...

37:30.620 --> 37:31.540
Man'er,

37:32.410 --> 37:34.190
if there's anything

37:34.220 --> 37:36.070
that I've done wrong,

37:36.660 --> 37:38.310
just tell me.

37:39.460 --> 37:41.290
There's no need to insult me like this.

37:43.690 --> 37:44.850
Give me the melon.

37:45.500 --> 37:45.980
You...

37:46.420 --> 37:46.900
You...

37:47.180 --> 37:48.480
Lian Man'er, don't eat it.

37:48.580 --> 37:49.750
Mother, look at her.

37:50.890 --> 37:51.740
Give it to me.

37:52.020 --> 37:52.720
Give it to me.

37:52.760 --> 37:54.450
Give it to me. Mom, come here!

37:54.480 --> 37:55.760
-Take it back.
-I...

37:58.290 --> 37:59.700
Lian Man'er!

38:28.170 --> 38:29.460
I go to bed right after eating dinner.

38:30.300 --> 38:31.580
There's no phone or internet.

38:32.140 --> 38:33.550
There's not even an electric fan.

38:38.100 --> 38:39.820
I really, really miss it.

38:41.860 --> 38:44.710
I miss my phone so much.

38:45.940 --> 38:49.180
I really want to watch dramas.

38:54.740 --> 38:56.860
How can I

38:58.620 --> 39:00.580
pass such a long night?

40:25.030 --> 40:26.170
[Happiness]

40:34.400 --> 40:36.480
I won't go!

40:36.920 --> 40:38.840
Let go of me!

40:39.420 --> 40:40.170
Murder is illegal.

40:40.170 --> 40:41.060
Don't you know that?

40:45.330 --> 40:46.350
Stop shouting.

40:46.690 --> 40:49.170
[Sun Li's father, Sun Changsheng]

40:46.840 --> 40:48.870
No one will find us here.

40:50.260 --> 40:51.460
I planned to wait

40:51.940 --> 40:53.410
until you went to accompany my son

40:53.860 --> 40:54.820
and tell the Lian family

40:55.140 --> 40:57.670
that you fell ill after getting married

40:57.980 --> 40:59.230
and passed away.

41:00.060 --> 41:01.020
Now, it seems

41:01.900 --> 41:02.860
that I don't need to anymore.

41:03.940 --> 41:05.250
Lord Sun, you truly worked hard

41:05.500 --> 41:06.850
for your son.

41:07.620 --> 41:08.860
But have you ever considered

41:09.380 --> 41:10.630
that these are just superstitions?

41:10.670 --> 41:11.800
They're all lies.

41:12.100 --> 41:13.460
It won't do your son any good.

41:13.660 --> 41:14.740
It will only add to your sins.

41:18.020 --> 41:18.740
So,

41:19.020 --> 41:20.050
we shouldn't do

41:20.080 --> 41:21.610
these difficult and illegal things.

41:22.120 --> 41:22.650
Lord Sun,

41:23.020 --> 41:24.100
you can still change your mind.

41:25.050 --> 41:26.620
Thank you for reminding me.

41:27.140 --> 41:28.660
After you go,

41:28.780 --> 41:30.980
I will become a vegetarian and pray to the Buddha

41:31.010 --> 41:32.890
to bless my son.

41:33.380 --> 41:34.940
That's not what I meant.

41:35.140 --> 41:35.660
I...

41:35.660 --> 41:37.340
No, you misunderstood.

41:37.560 --> 41:39.000
That's not what I meant.

41:40.940 --> 41:42.500
Lord, it's almost time.

41:44.060 --> 41:44.660
Forget it.

41:46.420 --> 41:47.180
Lord Sun,

41:48.450 --> 41:49.560
Before I go down,

41:49.870 --> 41:51.290
I have a wish.

41:52.020 --> 41:52.980
Go ahead.

41:54.430 --> 41:56.220
I want to take some money with me

41:57.380 --> 41:58.060
so that I can

41:58.460 --> 42:00.200
take good care of your son.

42:01.580 --> 42:02.340
Give it to her.

42:10.060 --> 42:10.700
Thank you.

42:30.800 --> 42:32.760
They lit the fire! Hurry!

43:09.080 --> 43:14.590
[Mission: 1,000 gold]

43:09.080 --> 43:14.590
[Income: widow burning to trick Lord Sun, 100 taels]

43:09.080 --> 43:14.590
[Expenses: 0]
